    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're just trying to enjoy life, but bugs keep attacking you everywhere you go. Your summer cottage, the desert, even your dreams - they're always there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twin-stick arcade shooter with bugs that won't leave you alone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a yellow arbitrary measure polytope, weaponize bureaucracy, or have an identity crisis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total of ten locations where you can't escape the bugs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One breakfast a day keeps the bugs at bay (or does it?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game engine I made myself because I'm stubborn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No meta-progression because I'm lazy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What players are saying:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;I couldn't figure out how to move&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The buttons should be styled&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;There's too much text&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is not a place of honor. Nothing valued is here. What is here is repulsive to us. The form of the danger is bugs. Lots of them.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're just trying to enjoy life, but bugs keep attacking you everywhere you go. Your summer cottage, the desert, even your dreams - they're always there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twin-stick arcade shooter with bugs that won't leave you alone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a yellow arbitrary measure polytope, weaponize bureaucracy, or have an identity crisis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total of ten locations where you can't escape the bugs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One breakfast a day keeps the bugs at bay (or does it?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game engine I made myself because I'm stubborn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No meta-progression because I'm lazy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What players are saying:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;I couldn't figure out how to move&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The buttons should be styled&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;There's too much text&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is not a place of honor. Nothing valued is here. What is here is repulsive to us. The form of the danger is bugs. Lots of them.</strong></p>",
